{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_adr_018_contrato_bloco_python_script_adr", "label": "ADR-018 \u2014 Contrato do bloco Python-Script", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-018-contrato-bloco-python-script.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_018_contrato_bloco_python_script_contrato_in_out_state", "label": "Contrato INx/OUTx/state do bloco Python-Script", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-018-contrato-bloco-python-script.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O bloco de script \u00e9 a v\u00e1lvula de escape para l\u00f3gica arbitr\u00e1ria (condicionamento, sele\u00e7\u00e3o, intertravamento leve) sem inflar a paleta. Portas definidas pelo usu\u00e1rio no modal; entradas IN1, IN2, ... e sa\u00eddas OUT1, OUT2, ... injetadas no escopo (o script atribui \u00e0s vari\u00e1veis OUTx); dict state persistente entre varreduras, por inst\u00e2ncia de bloco (sobrevive ao hot-swap se o bloco n\u00e3o for alterado, cf. ADR-011). Bibliotecas dispon\u00edveis: math e numpy \u2014 mais nada. Contrato simples de documentar e validar; nomes previs\u00edveis."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_018_contrato_bloco_python_script_exec_namespace_controlado", "label": "Execu\u00e7\u00e3o via exec() em namespace controlado, em executor", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-018-contrato-bloco-python-script.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Execu\u00e7\u00e3o via exec() em namespace controlado, rodando em executor (nunca no event loop); modelo de amea\u00e7a = admin autenticado, sem sandboxing pesado. Exce\u00e7\u00e3o no script: sa\u00eddas mant\u00eam \u00faltimo valor + alarme com traceback no log de eventos."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_018_contrato_bloco_python_script_timeout_script_70pct", "label": "Timeout de script = ~70% do Ts do flow", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-018-contrato-bloco-python-script.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Timeout de ~70% do Ts do flow; ao estourar, mant\u00e9m as \u00faltimas sa\u00eddas + alarme \u2014 mesma pol\u00edtica do MPC (ADR-014)."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_adr_018_contrato_bloco_python_script_adr", "target": "docs_adr_adr_018_contrato_bloco_python_script_contrato_in_out_state", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-018-contrato-bloco-python-script.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_adr_018_contrato_bloco_python_script_adr", "target": "docs_adr_adr_018_contrato_bloco_python_script_exec_namespace_controlado", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-018-contrato-bloco-python-script.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_adr_018_contrato_bloco_python_script_adr", "target": "docs_adr_adr_018_contrato_bloco_python_script_timeout_script_70pct", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-018-contrato-bloco-python-script.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_adr_018_contrato_bloco_python_script_adr", "target": "docs_adr_adr_011_hot_swap_sem_versionamento_adr", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-018-contrato-bloco-python-script.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_adr_018_contrato_bloco_python_script_adr", "target": "docs_adr_adr_014_orcamento_solver_multiplicador_adr", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-018-contrato-bloco-python-script.md", "source_location":